#{[{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186110379 :knowledge-point/_canonical-example [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "35fe6748-f040-5318-84e0-f3f76c9c7250" :knowledge-point/title "Simplifying an Expression Using the Cotangent-Cosecant Identity"}] :question/id #uuid "eceb2f88-2948-5037-bdbb-60483b3a2f34" :question/math-academy-id "e-3470" :question/problem "Simplify the trigonometric expression $\\sin \\theta \\, (1 + \\cot^2 \\theta)$." :question/worked-solution "First, using the identity\n\n$$\n1 + \\cot^2 \\theta = \\csc^2 \\theta\n$$\n\nwe rewrite the expression in the parentheses:\n\n$$\n\\sin θ(1 + \\cot^{2} θ) = \\sin θ \\cdot \\csc^{2} θ\n$$\n\nThen, using the fact that\n\n$$\n\\csc {\\theta} = \\dfrac{1}{\\sin{\\theta}}\n$$\n\nwe can further simplify the expression:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\sin θ \\cdot \\csc^{2} θ &= \\sin θ \\cdot \\frac{1}{\\sin^{2} θ} \\\\\n&= \\sin θ \\cdot \\frac{1}{\\sin θ \\cdot \\sin θ} \\\\\n&= \\frac{1}{\\sin θ} \\\\\n&= \\csc θ\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186110380 :knowledge-point/_canonical-example [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "240a0a0b-fb86-5760-bb2b-74275708ff77" :knowledge-point/title "Simplifying an Expression Using the Alternate Forms of the Cotangent-Cosecant Identity"}] :question/id #uuid "0d77018a-b39f-57f6-b2b8-646c1ed73b9e" :question/math-academy-id "e-3472" :question/problem "Simplify $\\dfrac{1}{\\csc^2{\\theta} - 1}$." :question/worked-solution "First, let's recall the following identity:\n\n$$\n\\csc^2{\\theta} - 1 = \\cot^2{\\theta}\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above identity into the given expression, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\frac{1}{\\csc^{2} θ - 1} &= \\frac{1}{\\cot^{2} θ} = \\tan^{2} θ\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186110381 :knowledge-point/_canonical-example [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "d012a04e-f802-5a26-b900-0801427073d8" :knowledge-point/title "Simplifying an Expression by Factoring and Using Various Forms of the Cotangent-Cosecant Identity"}] :question/id #uuid "e3b17108-28ce-5a36-b211-05e6671c1f37" :question/math-academy-id "e-3473" :question/problem "Simplify $\\csc x + \\csc x \\cot^2 x -\\csc^3x$." :question/worked-solution "First, we factor $\\csc x$ from the first two terms, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\csc x + \\csc x\\cot^{2} x - \\csc^{3} x &= \\csc x(1 + \\cot^{2} x) - \\csc^{3} x\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, using the cotangent-cosecant identity,\n\n$$\n1+ \\cot^2 x=\\csc^2 x\n$$\n\nwe get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\csc x(1 + \\cot^{2} x) - \\csc^{3} x &= \\csc x \\cdot (\\csc^{2} x) - \\csc^{3} x \\\\\n&= \\csc^{3} x - \\csc^{3} x \\\\\n&= 0\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186110386 :knowledge-point/_canonical-example [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "85555bce-debf-5165-ba6a-3c232deeeb0a" :knowledge-point/title "Simplifying an Expression by Factoring the Alternate Forms of the Cotangent-Cosecant Identity"}] :question/id #uuid "4da93c71-9a1e-512e-9735-14d7c6221378" :question/math-academy-id "e-3497" :question/problem "Simplify $\\dfrac{1}{\\csc \\theta + \\cot \\theta} + \\cot \\theta$." :question/worked-solution "First, we recall the following identity:\n\n$$\n1= \\csc^2{\\theta} -\\cot^2{\\theta}\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above identity into the given expression, and then factoring it as a difference of squares, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\frac{1}{\\csc θ + \\cot θ} + \\cot θ &= \\frac{\\csc^{2} θ - \\cot^{2} θ}{\\csc θ + \\cot θ} + \\cot θ \\\\\n&= ((\\csc θ - \\cot θ)(\\csc θ + \\cot θ))/(\\csc θ + \\cot θ) + \\cot θ \\\\\n&= ((\\csc θ - \\cot θ)(\\csc θ + \\cot θ))/(\\csc θ + \\cot θ) + \\cot θ \\\\\n&= (\\csc θ - \\cot θ) + \\cot θ \\\\\n&= \\csc θ\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186268299 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "35fe6748-f040-5318-84e0-f3f76c9c7250" :knowledge-point/title "Simplifying an Expression Using the Cotangent-Cosecant Identity"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "ce114f73-29a6-54f2-b25f-12e0bd655a58" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-{cot}^{2}⁡z" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268301} {:answer/id #uuid "e7f6294f-5cf5-5e00-b0e9-674d048ec756" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{cot}^{2}⁡z" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268302} {:answer/id #uuid "5ac06c29-4562-5847-bcb1-79b67c2c605b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1-2{cot}^{2}⁡z" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268303} {:answer/id #uuid "ffd304f0-487d-545e-ac7e-35fef5375b5c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\operatorname{cot}⁡z+2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268304} {:answer/id #uuid "139f287c-1093-5f97-9669-e9552a81837a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}{cot}^{2}⁡z" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268305}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "e7f6294f-5cf5-5e00-b0e9-674d048ec756" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{cot}^{2}⁡z" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268302} :answer-field/id #uuid "8025b57f-1986-505f-8bd2-889d54e3cb36" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268300}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "eeccf685-0dc7-5f37-ae64-553f4ec2ec9b" :question/math-academy-id "q-119904" :question/problem "Simplify ${cos}^{2}⁡z\\,({cot}^{2}⁡z+1).$" :question/worked-solution "Using the identity $1+{cot}^{2}⁡z={csc}^{2}⁡z,$ we rewrite and simplify the expression as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{cos}^{2}⁡z\\,({cot}^{2}⁡z+1) & ={cos}^{2}⁡z\\cdot {csc}^{2}⁡z \\\\  & ={cos}^{2}⁡z\\cdot {(\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡z})}^{2} \\\\  & ={cos}^{2}⁡z\\cdot \\frac{1}{{sin}^{2}⁡z} \\\\  & =\\frac{{cos}^{2}⁡z}{{sin}^{2}⁡z} \\\\  & ={(\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡z}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡z})}^{2} \\\\  & ={cot}^{2}⁡z\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186268306 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "35fe6748-f040-5318-84e0-f3f76c9c7250" :knowledge-point/title "Simplifying an Expression Using the Cotangent-Cosecant Identity"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "d52a68c6-0090-578d-93b3-08738a8ae81d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\operatorname{sin}⁡w" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268308} {:answer/id #uuid "6d0f005c-da26-572a-91ff-7b1540cafbb0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268309} {:answer/id #uuid "71a67aa9-f94b-57c3-bfb6-f234ef82a16b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268310} {:answer/id #uuid "4c7ae460-5c79-546b-b5c8-5fa6561e7bf4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268311} {:answer/id #uuid "13261a83-f4dd-5465-b002-106190ed49a0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\operatorname{sin}⁡w" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268312}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "71a67aa9-f94b-57c3-bfb6-f234ef82a16b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268310} :answer-field/id #uuid "078b395b-682d-56d8-acf3-3a1292bead46" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268307}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "3be4fc32-8572-5ad7-a10a-45856f55365c" :question/math-academy-id "q-119905" :question/problem "Simplify ${sin}^{2}⁡w\\,(1+{cot}^{2}⁡w).$" :question/worked-solution "Using the identity $1+{cot}^{2}⁡w={csc}^{2}⁡w,$ we rewrite and simplify the expression as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{sin}^{2}⁡w\\,(1+{cot}^{2}⁡w) & ={sin}^{2}⁡w\\cdot {csc}^{2}⁡w \\\\  & ={sin}^{2}⁡w\\cdot {(\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡w})}^{2} \\\\  & ={sin}^{2}⁡w\\cdot \\frac{1}{{sin}^{2}⁡w} \\\\  & =1\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186268313 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "35fe6748-f040-5318-84e0-f3f76c9c7250" :knowledge-point/title "Simplifying an Expression Using the Cotangent-Cosecant Identity"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0d68e1b1-e963-5e08-886b-abdd1a4d8e66" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2\\operatorname{sec}⁡\\theta " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268315} {:answer/id #uuid "e89d6962-1fc5-5925-9e67-a3aa4dd030b4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\operatorname{sec}⁡\\theta " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268316} {:answer/id #uuid "fb23c8a6-f120-5862-acdb-e5d8508f1041" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\operatorname{sec}⁡\\theta +1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268317} {:answer/id #uuid "ad3c6ed7-dac3-5445-bf2a-612fdb91c0c6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1-\\operatorname{sec}⁡\\theta " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268318} {:answer/id #uuid "72628a44-156e-52d7-8447-458f19ae83d1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\operatorname{sec}⁡\\theta " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268319}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "e89d6962-1fc5-5925-9e67-a3aa4dd030b4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\operatorname{sec}⁡\\theta " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268316} :answer-field/id #uuid "e8bbefda-917b-5d66-838b-7c0dca1f6ff5" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268314}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "f19baf7b-dc78-56fb-ad0d-498f302b4f7c" :question/math-academy-id "q-119906" :question/problem "Simplify $\\frac{1+{cot}^{2}⁡\\theta }{\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta \\cdot \\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta }.$" :question/worked-solution "Using the identity $1+{cot}^{2}⁡\\theta ={csc}^{2}⁡\\theta ,$ we rewrite and simplify the expression as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1+{cot}^{2}⁡\\theta }{\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta \\cdot \\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta } & =\\frac{{csc}^{2}⁡\\theta }{\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta \\cdot \\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta } \\\\  & =\\frac{\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta }{\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta } \\\\  & =\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta \\cdot \\frac{1}{\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta } \\\\  & =\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta \\cdot \\operatorname{tan}⁡\\theta  \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta }\\cdot \\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta }{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta } \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta } \\\\  & =\\operatorname{sec}⁡\\theta \\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186110824 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "35fe6748-f040-5318-84e0-f3f76c9c7250" :knowledge-point/title "Simplifying an Expression Using the Cotangent-Cosecant Identity"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "9d48e5d0-98b8-5475-bed0-edeb7a789b3a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\tan θ" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186107206} {:answer/id #uuid "ba88bda1-cb8f-51c6-ab20-0ac70540c82b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1 - \\tan θ" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186107207} {:answer/id #uuid "35f58179-fb38-50a6-825b-ac4c1c7fee93" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2\\tan θ" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186107208} {:answer/id #uuid "6185db4e-22cf-57e2-a5c7-408531844ade" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\tan θ - 1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186107209} {:answer/id #uuid "68030b56-523c-5250-be43-b2d63d45be4c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\tan θ" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186107210}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "68030b56-523c-5250-be43-b2d63d45be4c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\tan θ" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186107210} :answer-field/id #uuid "cafb36fa-adb8-54b7-8b3e-456b8a358f55" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186107205}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "b383bf3c-484a-57e7-86ef-8a613fbe3df4" :question/math-academy-id "q-119914" :question/problem "What is $\\frac{\\csc^{2} θ}{\\cot θ} - \\cot θ$?" :question/worked-solution "Using the identity $1+{cot}^{2}⁡\\theta ={csc}^{2}⁡\\theta ,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{csc}^{2}⁡\\theta }{\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta }-\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta  & =\\frac{{csc}^{2}⁡\\theta -{cot}^{2}⁡\\theta }{\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta } \\\\  & =\\frac{1+{cot}^{2}⁡\\theta -{cot}^{2}⁡\\theta }{\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta } \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta } \\\\  & =\\operatorname{tan}⁡\\theta .\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186268320 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "d012a04e-f802-5a26-b900-0801427073d8" :knowledge-point/title "Simplifying an Expression by Factoring and Using Various Forms of the Cotangent-Cosecant Identity"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a6e49a5c-8595-5882-bcf6-b9a1841dbd6c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2{cot}^{4}⁡x+1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268322} {:answer/id #uuid "5ca6784a-2d88-5643-bebc-c50716585f51" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-{cot}^{2}⁡x" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268323} {:answer/id #uuid "1d57c027-5d3e-5233-ac1a-45d3e779bf9a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2\\operatorname{cot}⁡x+1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268324} {:answer/id #uuid "6cd05115-33ea-5641-b961-ab838d4b1063" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1-\\operatorname{cot}⁡x" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268325} {:answer/id #uuid "3359c34a-2318-5fa7-be17-8405de1fd41b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{cot}^{4}⁡x" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268326}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "3359c34a-2318-5fa7-be17-8405de1fd41b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{cot}^{4}⁡x" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268326} :answer-field/id #uuid "3d70a19f-6e5d-5418-aeb0-ab9001df545d" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268321}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "b84edd58-8687-593a-a2b7-c6ebaf20bfb3" :question/math-academy-id "q-120081" :question/problem "Which of the following is equivalent to $({cot}^{2}⁡x+1)^{2}-2{csc}^{2}⁡x+1?$" :question/worked-solution "First, we recall the identities\n\n$$\n{cot}^{2}⁡x+1={csc}^{2}⁡x,\\,{csc}^{2}⁡x-1={cot}^{2}⁡x.\n$$\n\nThen, we simplify our expression using the above identities, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}({cot}^{2}⁡x+1)^{2}-2{csc}^{2}⁡x+1 & =({csc}^{2}⁡x)^{2}-2\\cdot {csc}^{2}⁡x\\cdot 1+{1}^{2} \\\\  & =({csc}^{2}⁡x-1)^{2} \\\\  & =({cot}^{2}⁡x)^{2} \\\\  & ={cot}^{4}⁡x\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186110921 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "35fe6748-f040-5318-84e0-f3f76c9c7250" :knowledge-point/title "Simplifying an Expression Using the Cotangent-Cosecant Identity"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "c6ab1aed-73a5-5d0e-be6b-b31988c3359e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\cos θ" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186107610} {:answer/id #uuid "f244413c-89c7-5edb-85da-e3160c49c68e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2\\cos θ" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186107611} {:answer/id #uuid "64d7ff7b-14cc-5ea2-94bb-dc1611d2f8d4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\cos^{2} θ" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186107612} {:answer/id #uuid "6e85ce22-a621-51f1-90c9-cae49e1ee598" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\cos θ" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186107613} {:answer/id #uuid "7070be80-8c82-5c50-8a85-fa03db9fef48" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2\\cos θ" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186107614}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "6e85ce22-a621-51f1-90c9-cae49e1ee598" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\cos θ" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186107613} :answer-field/id #uuid "8ec3119a-5e82-5276-8b18-61b6d8b2860b" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186107609}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "e2a7de17-dd0e-54fa-9258-ee9fa753362a" :question/math-academy-id "q-23602" :question/problem "Simplify $\\frac{\\csc θ \\cdot \\cot θ}{1 + \\cot^{2} θ}$." :question/worked-solution "Using the identity $1+{cot}^{2}⁡\\theta ={csc}^{2}⁡\\theta ,$ we rewrite and simplify the expression as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta \\cdot \\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta }{1+{cot}^{2}⁡\\theta } & =\\frac{\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta \\cdot \\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta }{{csc}^{2}⁡\\theta } \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta }\\cdot \\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta  \\\\  & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta \\cdot \\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta }{\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta } \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta \\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186268327 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "d012a04e-f802-5a26-b900-0801427073d8" :knowledge-point/title "Simplifying an Expression by Factoring and Using Various Forms of the Cotangent-Cosecant Identity"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "60493825-c5ff-5b7d-bd82-60dbb1fe4dba" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268329} {:answer/id #uuid "102d98fd-beb8-5901-870e-cbad5c9e5770" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268330} {:answer/id #uuid "b4079ee3-160b-56c6-9c33-ec99badfdcc9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268331} {:answer/id #uuid "d6bfb860-ebb4-536b-afaa-18f66ddf6ec2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268332} {:answer/id #uuid "4bf5c794-c5a3-55b4-9ab3-851f8f5751b1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268333}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "b4079ee3-160b-56c6-9c33-ec99badfdcc9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268331} :answer-field/id #uuid "6894acbb-9786-5c45-b366-c6e0ba5ad152" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268328}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "980c890f-3de7-5a02-b9cb-897058d926e2" :question/math-academy-id "q-23640" :question/problem "Simplify ${csc}^{4}⁡x-2{csc}^{2}⁡x\\cdot {cot}^{2}⁡x+{cot}^{4}⁡x.$" :question/worked-solution "First,  notice that the given expression is a perfect square:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{csc}^{4}⁡x-2{csc}^{2}⁡x\\,\\cdot \\,{cot}^{2}⁡x+{cot}^{4}⁡x & ={({csc}^{2}⁡x-{cot}^{2}⁡x)}^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, using the  identity ${csc}^{2}⁡x-{cot}^{2}⁡x=1$, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{({csc}^{2}⁡x-{cot}^{2}⁡x)}^{2} & =(1)^{2} \\\\  & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186268334 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "240a0a0b-fb86-5760-bb2b-74275708ff77" :knowledge-point/title "Simplifying an Expression Using the Alternate Forms of the Cotangent-Cosecant Identity"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "9ce47549-1158-5b52-b608-a338c01e5b15" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268336} {:answer/id #uuid "25002b55-54e3-5aa6-9e2c-9ae47756afd0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268337} {:answer/id #uuid "3c88912e-fce0-5f78-944c-1bcab295d106" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268338} {:answer/id #uuid "64c35499-929c-5cdd-8109-9f707a5fc9ae" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268339} {:answer/id #uuid "f84606ba-e376-5b29-b2eb-c55c4596dc67" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268340}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "3c88912e-fce0-5f78-944c-1bcab295d106" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268338} :answer-field/id #uuid "6cd3b6c2-b555-5aab-80db-6caaa2665929" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268335}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "3af4bdea-2cb0-5697-9158-3118d7b94c96" :question/math-academy-id "q-23849" :question/problem "Simplify $\\frac{{cot}^{2}⁡x}{{csc}^{2}⁡x}-1+{sin}^{2}⁡x$" :question/worked-solution "First, we operate the first two terms, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{cot}^{2}⁡x}{{csc}^{2}⁡x}-1+{sin}^{2}⁡x & =\\frac{({cot}^{2}⁡x-{csc}^{2}⁡x)}{{csc}^{2}⁡x}+{sin}^{2}⁡x \\\\  & =\\frac{-({csc}^{2}⁡x-{cot}^{2}⁡x)}{{csc}^{2}⁡x}+{sin}^{2}⁡x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, using the identity ${csc}^{2}⁡x-{cot}^{2}⁡x=1,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{-({csc}^{2}⁡x-{cot}^{2}⁡x)}{{csc}^{2}⁡x}+{sin}^{2}⁡x & =\\frac{-1}{{csc}^{2}⁡x}+{sin}^{2}⁡x \\\\  & =-{sin}^{2}⁡x+{sin}^{2}⁡x \\\\  & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186268341 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "d012a04e-f802-5a26-b900-0801427073d8" :knowledge-point/title "Simplifying an Expression by Factoring and Using Various Forms of the Cotangent-Cosecant Identity"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "e36dec92-0c79-544d-9a72-2c8f4583cb03" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268343} {:answer/id #uuid "f13643f5-3f51-5cc1-8cc6-06d852e66231" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{csc}^{4}⁡\\theta " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268344} {:answer/id #uuid "a1cd5cd0-4b73-5733-8592-5226f6131a49" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{csc}^{3}⁡x" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268345} {:answer/id #uuid "3c617800-ee97-5b9b-ae56-a059b94b5748" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{csc}^{2}⁡\\theta " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268346} {:answer/id #uuid "f2339498-1161-5956-b7ca-129526547381" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1+{csc}^{2}⁡\\theta " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268347}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "f13643f5-3f51-5cc1-8cc6-06d852e66231" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{csc}^{4}⁡\\theta " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268344} :answer-field/id #uuid "7ba4e7b6-6a63-550c-8baf-b9f4d00e6a7f" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268342}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "b2966801-6ab8-5874-8a01-28a3e5a359b9" :question/math-academy-id "q-23897" :question/problem "Simplify $1+{cot}^{2}⁡\\theta +{cot}^{2}⁡\\theta \\,{csc}^{2}⁡\\theta .$" :question/worked-solution "First, we use the identity $1+{cot}^{2}⁡\\theta ={csc}^{2}⁡\\theta ,$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}1+{cot}^{2}⁡\\theta +{cot}^{2}⁡\\theta \\,{csc}^{2}⁡\\theta  & =[1+{cot}^{2}⁡\\theta ]+{cot}^{2}⁡\\theta \\,{csc}^{2}⁡\\theta  \\\\  & ={csc}^{2}⁡\\theta +{cot}^{2}⁡\\theta \\,{csc}^{2}⁡\\theta \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we factor out ${csc}^{2}⁡\\theta ,$ and we use the identity $1+{cot}^{2}⁡\\theta ={csc}^{2}⁡\\theta $ again. This gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{csc}^{2}⁡\\theta +{cot}^{2}⁡\\theta \\,{csc}^{2}⁡\\theta  & ={csc}^{2}⁡\\theta (1+{cot}^{2}⁡\\theta ) \\\\  & ={csc}^{2}⁡\\theta \\,({csc}^{2}⁡\\theta )\\, \\\\  & ={csc}^{4}⁡\\theta .\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186268348 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "d012a04e-f802-5a26-b900-0801427073d8" :knowledge-point/title "Simplifying an Expression by Factoring and Using Various Forms of the Cotangent-Cosecant Identity"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5da326ff-5313-5ea1-8f01-a7a5fe165fdb" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268350} {:answer/id #uuid "e2225c8f-7e40-50be-b80e-f7cfbbc3e90f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268351} {:answer/id #uuid "8c30b419-1e2f-5140-90a3-26f614719b11" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268352} {:answer/id #uuid "f1e2f203-484c-5b73-a548-038b5c5f02c2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268353} {:answer/id #uuid "bf6b060e-6f0c-57cc-8b52-bdbbfa7fa2ce" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268354}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "8c30b419-1e2f-5140-90a3-26f614719b11" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268352} :answer-field/id #uuid "1c398610-b483-5f76-b45d-51164efd2e76" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268349}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "84f518b9-fd0b-50e1-be62-a72c4dbfce8d" :question/math-academy-id "q-23898" :question/problem "Simplify ${tan}^{2}⁡\\theta \\,{csc}^{2}⁡\\theta -\\frac{1}{{cot}^{2}⁡\\theta }.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we write the given expression as:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{tan}^{2}⁡\\theta \\,{csc}^{2}⁡\\theta -\\frac{1}{{cot}^{2}⁡\\theta } & ={tan}^{2}⁡\\theta \\,{csc}^{2}⁡\\theta -{tan}^{2}⁡\\theta \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we factor out ${tan}^{2}⁡\\theta $ and use the identity \n${csc}^{2}⁡\\theta -1={cot}^{2}⁡\\theta .$\nThis gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{tan}^{2}⁡\\theta \\,{csc}^{2}⁡\\theta -{tan}^{2}⁡\\theta  & ={tan}^{2}⁡\\theta \\,({csc}^{2}⁡\\theta -1) \\\\  & ={tan}^{2}⁡\\theta \\,{cot}^{2}⁡\\theta  \\\\  & ={tan}^{2}⁡\\theta \\cdot \\frac{1}{{tan}^{2}⁡\\theta } \\\\  & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186268355 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "240a0a0b-fb86-5760-bb2b-74275708ff77" :knowledge-point/title "Simplifying an Expression Using the Alternate Forms of the Cotangent-Cosecant Identity"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "ac91297b-638d-581a-bdca-96a2e2ce33c9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2{tan}^{2}⁡\\theta " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268357} {:answer/id #uuid "5d4e075b-fa47-572a-8a32-905cb34f3778" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268358} {:answer/id #uuid "3b4e1f71-65b4-565e-aa40-263a9644922b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{cot}^{2}⁡\\theta " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268359} {:answer/id #uuid "6fe00325-39e6-5225-830b-87ce3bc5ac77" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268360} {:answer/id #uuid "a1014752-47fe-57cf-a324-9a8ebbb6288e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1+\\operatorname{tan}⁡\\theta " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268361}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ac91297b-638d-581a-bdca-96a2e2ce33c9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2{tan}^{2}⁡\\theta " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268357} :answer-field/id #uuid "98aa8544-a7bd-53de-87cb-280e74bf5fbe" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268356}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "aad44bd9-8533-589f-aaf2-4a6104582560" :question/math-academy-id "q-43295" :question/problem "Simplify $\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta -1}-\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta +1}.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we put both fractions over a common denominator and then subtract, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta -1}-\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta +1} & =\\frac{1\\cdot (\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta +1)}{(\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta -1)(\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta +1)}-\\frac{1\\cdot (\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta -1)}{(\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta -1)(\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta +1)} \\\\  & =\\frac{(\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta +1)-(\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta -1)}{(\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta -1)(\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta +1)} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta +1-\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta +1}{{csc}^{2}⁡\\theta -1} \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{{csc}^{2}⁡\\theta -1}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUsing the identity ${csc}^{2}⁡\\theta -1={cot}^{2}⁡\\theta ,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{2}{{csc}^{2}⁡\\theta -1} & =\\frac{2}{{cot}^{2}⁡\\theta } \\\\  & =2{tan}^{2}⁡\\theta .\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we conclude that\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta -1}-\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta +1}=2{tan}^{2}⁡\\theta .\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186111280 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "240a0a0b-fb86-5760-bb2b-74275708ff77" :knowledge-point/title "Simplifying an Expression Using the Alternate Forms of the Cotangent-Cosecant Identity"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a667ccda-e58a-522d-9135-7b88dbe0a1df" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2\\tan θ" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186109776} {:answer/id #uuid "c5db7ae8-f206-5755-9698-37fcbd3e2195" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\tan^{2} θ" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186109777} {:answer/id #uuid "281ac1a6-095d-50ef-9492-3982e6bf5848" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\tan^{2} θ + 2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186109778} {:answer/id #uuid "430bc087-6e8d-5499-8c1c-093c8ea7f438" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2\\tan^{2} θ" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186109779} {:answer/id #uuid "7ca2656d-951a-5ea5-bf29-25b194c1c040" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\tan θ" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186109780}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "7ca2656d-951a-5ea5-bf29-25b194c1c040" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\tan θ" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186109780} :answer-field/id #uuid "e5d56a5d-7a75-5790-b8ab-ba8071ca786c" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186109775}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "766b9a4b-725f-56b5-a9b2-58088876a3e5" :question/math-academy-id "q-65444" :question/problem "Simplify $\\frac{\\cot θ}{\\csc^{2} θ - 1}$." :question/worked-solution "First, let's recall the following identity:\n\n$$\n{csc}^{2}⁡\\theta -1={cot}^{2}⁡\\theta \n$$\n\nSubstituting the above identity into the given expression, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta }{{csc}^{2}⁡\\theta -1} & =\\frac{\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta }{{cot}^{2}⁡\\theta } \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{cot}⁡x} \\\\  & =\\operatorname{tan}⁡\\theta .\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186268362 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "240a0a0b-fb86-5760-bb2b-74275708ff77" :knowledge-point/title "Simplifying an Expression Using the Alternate Forms of the Cotangent-Cosecant Identity"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5f6cf457-10c2-533a-948d-e13121c2eb87" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268364} {:answer/id #uuid "e8b0f6ac-f68d-506d-a5a7-7f45990e741c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "5${sin}^{2}⁡2\\theta $" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268365} {:answer/id #uuid "d1e4a2cb-249d-509e-aac8-5f06749b1506" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\operatorname{sin}⁡2\\theta " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268366} {:answer/id #uuid "4bcff514-fa8c-58b7-bc6a-3b0a9652d628" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268367} {:answer/id #uuid "9233093c-de2f-5a90-8ef4-555985b6204e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{sin}^{2}⁡2\\theta " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268368}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "5f6cf457-10c2-533a-948d-e13121c2eb87" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268364} :answer-field/id #uuid "b3d33571-6b12-5036-96e0-0c2166c75e64" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268363}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "352701d5-a208-54ef-8cd7-c9cecf0ae513" :question/math-academy-id "q-65445" :question/problem "Simplify $\\frac{{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta }{{csc}^{2}⁡\\theta -1}.$" :question/worked-solution "First, let's recall the following identity:\n\n$$\n{csc}^{2}⁡\\theta -1={cot}^{2}⁡\\theta \n$$\n\nSubstituting the above identity into the given expression, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta }{{csc}^{2}⁡\\theta -1} & =\\frac{{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta }{{cot}^{2}⁡\\theta } \\\\  & ={cos}^{2}⁡\\theta \\cdot {tan}^{2}⁡\\theta  \\\\  & ={cos}^{2}⁡\\theta \\cdot \\frac{{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta }{{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta } \\\\  & =\\cancel{{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta }\\cdot \\frac{{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta }{\\cancel{{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta }} \\\\  & ={sin}^{2}⁡\\theta .\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186268369 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "85555bce-debf-5165-ba6a-3c232deeeb0a" :knowledge-point/title "Simplifying an Expression by Factoring the Alternate Forms of the Cotangent-Cosecant Identity"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "c694f929-31f0-5cf9-bcec-ce8d98f88416" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268371} {:answer/id #uuid "44477460-07ab-5750-bfe7-1054d151d9f6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268372} {:answer/id #uuid "5baa68ad-b209-5095-ba8b-9095a58fca5a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{cot}^{2}⁡\\theta " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268373} {:answer/id #uuid "5f5ddaa7-989e-5f37-8dcb-5d6bddc8b781" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta +1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268374} {:answer/id #uuid "ab690828-8f48-56a0-a5cb-8f6961a7714f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3{cot}^{2}⁡\\theta " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268375}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "c694f929-31f0-5cf9-bcec-ce8d98f88416" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268371} :answer-field/id #uuid "88d4cb5c-8188-5525-8314-b4b929de9e82" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268370}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "918e6995-ee59-5fed-9571-6d5d741aef1e" :question/math-academy-id "q-65446" :question/problem "Simplify $\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta -\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta }-\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta .$" :question/worked-solution "First, let's recall the following identity: \n\n$$\n1={csc}^{2}⁡\\theta -{cot}^{2}⁡\\theta \n$$\n\nSubstituting the above identity into the given expression, and then factoring it as a difference of squares, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta -\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta }-\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta  & =\\frac{{csc}^{2}⁡\\theta -{cot}^{2}⁡\\theta }{\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta -\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta }-\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta  \\\\  & =\\frac{(\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta -\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta )\\,(\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta +\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta )}{\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta -\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta }-\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta  \\\\  & =\\frac{\\cancel{(\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta -\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta )}\\,(\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta +\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta )}{\\cancel{\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta -\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta }}-\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta  \\\\  & =\\cancel{\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta }+\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta -\\cancel{\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta } \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta .\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186268376 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "d012a04e-f802-5a26-b900-0801427073d8" :knowledge-point/title "Simplifying an Expression by Factoring and Using Various Forms of the Cotangent-Cosecant Identity"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "548474f7-d9c6-5c86-8950-91f6db6e9dea" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268378} {:answer/id #uuid "81db3669-de89-5a1e-890b-409e69134b4d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\sqrt{3}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268379} {:answer/id #uuid "02ffc45f-d319-5078-9d34-f03f958c9b80" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268380} {:answer/id #uuid "044bb353-1f2a-5ac8-bb34-5b66c6f71314" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268381} {:answer/id #uuid "2d36e5ff-cd6a-5b5c-8ae4-983ca50fbd7f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268382}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "02ffc45f-d319-5078-9d34-f03f958c9b80" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268380} :answer-field/id #uuid "f0eda906-83c6-5033-a298-6ea989df590d" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268377}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "f432efc9-8cc9-54ba-b773-a3c1cbb90f47" :question/math-academy-id "q-65457" :question/problem "Simplify ${sin}^{2}⁡x+{sin}^{2}⁡x\\cdot {cot}^{2}⁡x+1.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we factor the ${sin}^{2}⁡x$ from the first two terms:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{sin}^{2}⁡x+{sin}^{2}⁡x\\cdot {cot}^{2}⁡x+1 & ={sin}^{2}⁡x(1+{cot}^{2}⁡x)+1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, using the identity $1+{cot}^{2}⁡x={csc}^{2}⁡x,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{sin}^{2}⁡x(1+{cot}^{2}⁡x)+1 & ={sin}^{2}⁡x({csc}^{2}⁡x)+1 \\\\  & =\\cancel{{sin}^{2}⁡x}(\\frac{1}{\\cancel{{sin}^{2}⁡x}})+1 \\\\  & =1+1 \\\\  & =2.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186268383 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "240a0a0b-fb86-5760-bb2b-74275708ff77" :knowledge-point/title "Simplifying an Expression Using the Alternate Forms of the Cotangent-Cosecant Identity"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "f9db9f1e-9cf5-59a5-b0a9-7bee506d42b1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268385} {:answer/id #uuid "69b27719-ff44-59ff-9ac0-d64dcd71aa79" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1-\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268386} {:answer/id #uuid "0f579bdb-b9f4-578b-871d-f7bd553664ca" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1+\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268387} {:answer/id #uuid "9b6ea390-db10-5c1f-abd8-3fe5e13ff539" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268388} {:answer/id #uuid "7e95a24e-ba01-580f-a2e5-6b3a93e905ac" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta -1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268389}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "0f579bdb-b9f4-578b-871d-f7bd553664ca" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1+\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268387} :answer-field/id #uuid "f5398ef7-22cf-5fc8-b8e4-5485f18d4005" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268384}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "64b79972-307d-573c-b12c-d167479196b5" :question/math-academy-id "q-65518" :question/problem "Simplify $\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta \\,\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta }{\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta -1}.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we multiply the numerator and the denominator of our expression by $\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta +1.$ This gives:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta \\,\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta }{\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta -1} & =\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta \\,\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta }{\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta -1}\\cdot \\frac{\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta +1}{\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta +1} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta \\,\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta \\,(\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta +1)}{{csc}^{2}⁡\\theta -1}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, using the identity ${csc}^{2}⁡\\theta -1={cot}^{2}⁡\\theta $, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta \\,\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta \\,(\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta +1)}{{csc}^{2}⁡\\theta -1} & =\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta \\,\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta \\,(\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta +1)}{{cot}^{2}⁡\\theta } \\\\  & =\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta \\,\\cancel{\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta }\\,(\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta +1)}{\\cancel{\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta }\\cdot \\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta } \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta \\,\\operatorname{tan}⁡\\theta \\,(\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta +1) \\\\  & =\\cancel{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta }\\cdot \\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta }{\\cancel{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta }}\\,(\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta +1) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta \\,(\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta +1) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta \\,\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta +\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta  \\\\  & =\\cancel{\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta }\\cdot \\frac{1}{\\cancel{\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta }}+\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta  \\\\  & =1+\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta .\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186268390 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "85555bce-debf-5165-ba6a-3c232deeeb0a" :knowledge-point/title "Simplifying an Expression by Factoring the Alternate Forms of the Cotangent-Cosecant Identity"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "41caff96-9660-50aa-96b9-b5f283153208" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta +1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268392} {:answer/id #uuid "c33fc37d-9cb6-5222-a913-22c27c4e9ed0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1-\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268393} {:answer/id #uuid "60c562e5-b993-5ee2-830b-72d0f4ea33a4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta -1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268394} {:answer/id #uuid "76e61628-5c7c-5f7e-8db7-720dfe99d092" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1+2\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268395} {:answer/id #uuid "2a23d9fb-1e23-5fd6-8326-df27aff0c4d2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta +1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268396}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "2a23d9fb-1e23-5fd6-8326-df27aff0c4d2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta +1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268396} :answer-field/id #uuid "06746073-c561-57a1-8f35-979f3ddd0632" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268391}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "6c8d4b7e-2c72-5d0d-be45-d5b74c86b7f5" :question/math-academy-id "q-74575" :question/problem "Simplify $\\frac{{cot}^{2}⁡\\theta }{\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta -1}.$" :question/worked-solution "First, let's recall the following identity: \n\n$$\n{cot}^{2}⁡\\theta ={csc}^{2}⁡\\theta -1\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above identity into the given expression, and then factoring it as a difference of squares, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{cot}^{2}⁡\\theta }{\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta -1} & =\\frac{{csc}^{2}⁡\\theta -1}{\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta -1} \\\\  & =\\frac{(\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta +1)(\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta -1)}{\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta -1} \\\\  & =\\frac{(\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta +1)\\cancel{(\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta -1)}}{\\cancel{\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta -1}} \\\\  & =\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta +1.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186268397 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "85555bce-debf-5165-ba6a-3c232deeeb0a" :knowledge-point/title "Simplifying an Expression by Factoring the Alternate Forms of the Cotangent-Cosecant Identity"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "7b2955e0-60a5-513b-a313-4350a3df65f5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268399} {:answer/id #uuid "f43cf306-438f-5740-8786-679bf1bab431" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1-\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268400} {:answer/id #uuid "4ae29231-6051-5362-8223-9d45ed05c77e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1+\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268401} {:answer/id #uuid "6a7296c6-8dc0-50d2-a42e-4393ee7e8817" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268402} {:answer/id #uuid "a9806e45-9a12-53e9-ab8b-1311df3657bb" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268403}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "7b2955e0-60a5-513b-a313-4350a3df65f5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268399} :